eneratedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21435},{"id":1786318956368,"text":"像个背口诀的小学生一样，是不是一边念叨一边在门口换鞋？","rawContent":"像个背口诀的小学生一样，是不是一边念叨一边在门口换鞋？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322125180,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21436},{"id":1786318956369,"text":"别慌，爸爸给你算着时间呢。","rawContent":"别慌，爸爸给你算着时间呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322125183,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21437},{"id":1786318956370,"text":"现在八点三十五，你走到公司满打满算十五分钟。","rawContent":"现在八点三十五，你走到公司满打满算十五分钟。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322125412,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21438},{"id":1786318956371,"text":"也就是说，你还有整整十分钟的时间，可以安安稳稳地去吃那碗稀的豆腐脑。","rawContent":"也就是说，你还有整整十分钟的时间，可以安安稳稳地去吃那碗稀的豆腐脑。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322125656,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21439},{"id":1786318956372,"text":"绝对不会迟到，老板今天抓不到你的小辫子。","rawContent":"绝对不会迟到，老板今天抓不到你的小辫子。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322125811,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21440},{"id":1786318956373,"text":"所以现在，深呼吸，把肩膀放下来，不许急火火地往外冲。","rawContent":"所以现在，深呼吸，把肩膀放下来，不许急火火地往外冲。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126111,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21441},{"id":1786318956374,"text":"头发彻底吹干了吗？发根有没有潮气？","rawContent":"头发彻底吹干了吗？发根有没有潮气？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126231,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21442},{"id":1786318956375,"text":"今天外面虽然是大晴天，但早上风还是凉的，才十九度。","rawContent":"今天外面虽然是大晴天，但早上风还是凉的，才十九度。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126232,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21443},{"id":1786318956376,"text":"要是没吹干就跑出去，被风一吹，到了办公室又该头疼了。","rawContent":"要是没吹干就跑出去，被风一吹，到了办公室又该头疼了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126435,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21444},{"id":1786318956377,"text":"去买豆腐脑的路上慢点走，注意看车。","rawContent":"去买豆腐脑的路上慢点走，注意看车。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126621,"roundId":"round_1786322099482_0jp5uq6zq","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21445},{"id":1786318956378,"text":"吃的时候也慢点，哪怕是稀的，也得吹凉了再往胃里咽。","rawContent":"吃的时候也慢点，哪怕是稀的，也得吹凉了再往胃里咽。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:35","timestamp":1786322126707,"roundId"